# #130 Lich's native check by parity: Death and Decay strikes twice and walking out avoids the second,
# Frost Armor chills a jabber, Dark Ritual shatters a shell for 30 mana, Frost Nova stopped by a
# shield, and the orb burst on the second press chills. Lich a against Lich b, a melee partner (b
# never casts, so nothing of b's interrupts a's orb); syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero lich
# b dashes in, inside Death and Decay's reach.
40 b stick -1 0
42 b stick 0 0
# Death and Decay ahead of a on b, who stays in it: struck twice.
70 a stick 1 0
70 a tap X 2
71 a stick 0 0
# a dashes in; Frost Armor; b walks up and jabs into the shell.
175 a stick 1 0
177 a stick 0 0
195 a stick 0 -1
195 a tap X 2
196 a stick 0 0
200 b press LB
200 b stick -1 0
218 b stick 0 0
218 b release LB
222 b tap A 2
# A second shell, cashed in by Dark Ritual while it holds.
270 a stick 0 -1
270 a tap X 2
271 a stick 0 0
320 a stick 0 -1
320 a tap X 2
321 a stick 0 0
# b dashes back; Death and Decay ahead lands on b, who dashes out after the first strike's hitstun.
350 b stick 1 0
352 b stick 0 0
370 a stick 1 0
370 a tap X 2
371 a stick 0 0
416 b stick -1 0
418 b stick 0 0
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
# Frost Nova into b's held shield: no hit, no chill.
520 a tap X 2
530 b shield 1
570 a release VIEW
630 b shield 0
# b runs off; Frost Nova again, and the second press bursts it in place on b and chills b.
640 b stick 1 0
660 a tap X 2
664 b stick 0 0
699 a tap X 2
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script):
# Death and Decay strikes b twice: 5% from its frame 30, 9% from its frame 70.
#! expect a 70 special 14 form 0
#! expect b 99 damage 5.000
#! expect b 139 damage 14.000
# Frost Armor takes the jab's reaction (damage, no hitstun) and chills b (checksums).
#! expect a 195 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 222 applied attack 1 style 0
#! expect a 227 damage 3.000 hitlag 4 hitstun 0
# Dark Ritual (down special's recall form) shatters the second shell: its burst strikes b; +30 mana (checksums).
#! expect a 270 special 16 form 0
#! expect a 320 special 16 form 3
#! expect b 325 damage 19.000
# The second Death and Decay strikes once; b has walked out before the second strike.
#! expect a 370 special 14 form 0
#! expect b 399 damage 24.000
#! absent b 400-519 damage
# Frost Nova into the shield: no hit.
#! expect a 520 special 13 form 0
#! absent b 521-707 damage
# Frost Nova's second press (recall form) bursts the orb: b takes the burst's 10, not the orb's 9, and is chilled.
#! expect a 660 special 13 form 0
#! expect a 699 special 13 form 3
#! expect b 708 damage 34.000
#! scene a DeathAndDecayTarget
#! scene a FrostArmorDamage
#! scene a DarkRitualTarget
#! scene a FrostNovaTarget
#! scene a FrostDamage
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
